M862.3 P "MK3" ; printer model check
M862.1 P0.4 ; nozzle diameter check
M115 U3.14.1 ; tell printer latest fw version
G90 ; use absolute coordinates
M83 ; extruder relative mode
M104 S220 ; set extruder temp
M140 S60 ; set bed temp
M190 S60 ; wait for bed temp
M109 S220 ; wait for extruder temp
G28 W ; home all without mesh bed level
G80 X83.5179 Y57.5179 W82.9642 H94.9642 ; mesh bed levelling

G1 Z0.2 F720
G1 Y-3 F1000 ; go outside print area
G92 E0
G1 X60 E9 F1000 ; intro line
G1 X100 E12.5 F1000 ; intro line
M73 P0 R92

G92 E0
M221 S95

; Don't change E values below. Excessive value can damage the printer.
M907 E430 ; set extruder motor current
G21 ; set units to millimeters
G90 ; use absolute coordinates
